flowchart TD
  C[Web / mobile clients] --> G[API gateway<br/>auth · routing · rate limits]
  G --> O[Order service]
  G --> P[Catalogue service]
  O -- "sync: charge (timeout 2 s)" --> Pay[Payment service]
  O --- ODB[(orders DB)]
  P --- PDB[(catalogue DB)]
  Pay --- PayDB[(payments DB)]
  O -- "OrderPlaced (outbox)" --> K{{Kafka}}
  K --> I[Inventory service]
  K --> N[Notification service]
  K --> S[Search indexer]
  I --- IDB[(inventory DB)]
